# web-accessibility-copy

> **Purpose:** Make the app usable by everyone and clear to read.
>
> **Applies to:** `apps/web/**`

## Accessibility
- All text meets WCAG AA contrast (4.5:1) in light and dark modes.
- Every interactive element is keyboard reachable, with a visible focus ring.
- Evidence details open on hover and on focus.
- Icon-only buttons need an `aria-label`.
- Use real buttons and links, not clickable divs.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Copy
- Use sentence case. No terminal punctuation on labels and buttons.
- Buttons start with a verb: "Copy link", "Retry run".
- Errors say what happened, then what to do.
- Never write "successfully", "please" or "click here".
- Say "Uncertain" plainly. Never soften or hide it.
